# wait real: a thread of the app's own (an engine's) works in real time; its wake-up reaches
# App::command and the timer that polls its result fires as the virtual clock follows the real
# one.  sync MS soft: a job that does not end in MS is no failure.
click "Hintergrund"
expect text:"Hintergrund: 0 Abfrage: läuft" exists
wait real 1200
expect text:"Hintergrund: 1 Abfrage: fertig" exists
click "Hängt"
sync 200 soft
expect text:"Hintergrund: 1 Abfrage: fertig" exists
click "Hängt"
sync 200
